==Battleground==
*1 [[Walpurgisnacht (Enemy)|Walpurgisnacht]] spawns as the boss after 7.4 seconds<sup>222f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As of Version 7.4, Walpurgisnacht was nerfed to 10% of its original power, making it very easy to deal with.

This was a seemingly hopeless battle against a foe which appears to be invincible, decimates almost anything you throw at it with a single blow, and strikes from massive range while stopping only for units standing directly in front of her. At least, this was the case in 2016.

As Walpurgisnacht has only a tenth of her true power in the 2018 and 2019 versions of [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|the event]], she can easily be thwarted with any fast-moving, fast-recharging cats with more than 8,000 health. [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] is one of the best options, as he is exceptionally fast and can quickly rush into Walpurgisnacht's standing range to prevent her from moving forward between attacks.

Another well-suited unit to bring is [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. At Level 30, he can defeat Walpurgisnacht in just three attacks.

With the [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]], which massively upgrades the [[:Category:Witch Killer Cats|Witch Killer]] ability, a sufficiently leveled [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]] and [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]] are more than a match for Walpurgisnacht. Any of the Madoka Magica Collab [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] (except for [[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|Bebe]] in her first form) can kill Walpurgisnacht in two hits by Level 30, and with My Very Best Friend active, even Bebe can destroy Walpurgisnacht in one shot when upgraded to Level 34.

Even in her weakened state, it is not advised to allow Walpurgisnacht to reach your base, as she can deal 32,000 damage per hit thanks to their Base Destroyer ability, and she cannot be pushed back or slowed down by any version of the [[Cat Cannon]].

Alternatively, spam fast units like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]], The normal [[Cat Cannon]] is useless, but the iron wall can make Walpurgisnacht start its attack again, stalling it for another 3 Seconds.

